    <h3>Workshops<o:p></o:p></h3>
    <p>eScience 2012 will include workshops on 8-9 October. In addition
      to the Microsoft eScience Workshop, other workshops were solicited
      in the <a
        href="http://www.ci.uchicago.edu/escience2012/call_for_workshops.php"><span
          style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New
          Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:major-fareast">Call for
          Workshops</span></a>. Six workshops were accepted: <o:p></o:p></p>
    <ul type="disc">
      <li class="MsoNormal"
        style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
        line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">8
        October: <a
          href="http://www.psc.edu/index.php/escience-2012-workshop">Extending


          High-Performance Computing Beyond its Traditional User
          Communities</a>, Papers due 6 August, Contact Person/email:
        Sergiu Sanielevici <a class="moz-txt-link-rfc2396E"
          href="mailto:sergiu@psc.edu">&lt;sergiu@psc.edu&gt;</a><o:p></o:p></li>
      <li class="MsoNormal"
        style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
        line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">8
        October: <a href="http://www.ci.uchicago.edu/eson2012/">2nd
          International Workshop on Analyzing and Improving
          Collaborative eScience with Social Networks (eSoN 12)</a>,
        Papers due 17 August, Contact Person/email: Kyle Chard <a
          class="moz-txt-link-rfc2396E"
          href="mailto:kyle@ci.uchicago.edu">&lt;kyle@ci.uchicago.edu&gt;</a><o:p></o:p></li>
      <li class="MsoNormal"
        style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
        line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">8
        October: <a
          href="http://www.scalalife.eu/content/advances-ehealth-2012-workshop">Advances


          in eHealth</a>, Abstracts due 4 July, Papers due 11 July,
        Contact Person/email: Rossen Apostolov <a
          class="moz-txt-link-rfc2396E" href="mailto:rossen@kth.se">&lt;rossen@kth.se&gt;</a><o:p></o:p></li>
      <li class="MsoNormal"
        style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
        line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">9
        October: <a
          href="http://software.ac.uk/maintainable-software-practice-workshop">Maintainable


          Software Practices in e-Science</a>, Papers due 20 July,
        Contact Person/email: Neil Chue Hong and Jennifer Schopf <a
          class="moz-txt-link-rfc2396E"
          href="mailto:softwarepractice2012@easychair.org">&lt;softwarepractice2012@easychair.org&gt;</a><o:p></o:p></li>
      <li class="MsoNormal"
        style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
        line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">9
        October: <a
href="https://confluence-vre.its.monash.edu.au/display/escience2012/eScience+Meets+the+Instrument">eScience


          Meets the Instrument,</a> Contact Person/email: Richard
        Farnsworth <a class="moz-txt-link-rfc2396E"
          href="mailto:rif@aps.anl.gov">&lt;rif@aps.anl.gov&gt;</a><o:p></o:p></li>
      <li class="MsoNormal"
        style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
        line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in">9
        October am: <a
href="http://www.surfnet.nl/en/Hybride_netwerk/SURFlichtpaden/Pages/CollaborativeresearchusingeScienceinfrastructureandhighspeednetworks.aspx">Collaborative


